OL,3,GNEWSADriver charged over death of man
OL,4,Astruck by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has been charged with causing
OL,7,Fdeath by dangerous driving after a man
OL,8,Fdied following a hit-and-run crash in
OL,9,FBirmingham.
OL,11,FThe man, in his 30s, died at the scene
OL,12,Fon Sladefield Road after he was struck
OL,13,Fby a car at about 00:15 GMT on
OL,14,FSaturday, West Midlands Police said.
OL,16,FMohammed Navid, 29, from Birmingham,
OL,17,Fhas been remanded in custody and will
OL,18,Fappear before city magistrates' on
OL,19,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
